==== Unit repair ====
{{Repairing
| head=1
| Damaged Chainmail Leggings
| Damaged Chainmail Leggings; Iron Ingot
| Chainmail Leggings
| tail=1
}}

Chainmail leggings can also be repaired in an [[anvil]] by adding [[iron ingot]]s, with each ingot restoring 25% the leggings' maximum durability, rounded down. Two pairs of leggings of the same tier can also be combined in an anvil. Both methods using the anvil preserve the leggings' [[enchantment]]s.

